@startuml Goods Movement Sequence

' TARGET DESIGN (ADRs 0004, 0005, 0006, 0011). The code still implements the earlier approval fork
' until docs/plans/08 and docs/plans/15 merge; that version of this file is in git history at f659eed.

title Box attestation -> allocation -> load sign-off -> declarations
caption Target design. ADRs 0004, 0005, 0006, 0011. See docs/process/goods-movements.md.

actor Loader
actor Dispatcher
actor Admin as "Administrator"
actor "Ground Officer" as GO
participant "Freedom API" as API
database "SQL Database" as DB
queue "customs-work" as GmrQueue
queue "elo-envelopes" as EloQueue
participant "Customs Worker" as Worker
participant "HMRC GVMS" as HMRC
participant "French ELO API" as Elo
participant "EU Customs\nTrader Portal" as EU
participant "Blob Storage" as Blob

== Box attestation ==

Loader -> API: POST /boxes/{id}/validate
API -> DB: UPDATE dbo.Box SET ValidatedAt, ValidatedByPersonId (from the login)\nWHERE Id = @id AND ValidatedAt IS NULL
API --> Loader: 200
note right of DB
  Contents are fixed. A change means
  replacing the box (POST /boxes/{id}/replace).
end note

== Allocation to a vehicle ==

Dispatcher -> API: PUT /convoys/{id}/vehicles/{vin}/boxes/{boxId}
API -> DB: box must be attested, Receiver registered
API -> DB: upsert ConvoyVehicleBoxAllocation (one vehicle per box)
API --> Dispatcher: 200

== Load sign-off ==

Dispatcher -> API: POST /manifests/{id}/propose
Admin -> API: POST /manifests/{id}/approve
API -> DB: UPDATE dbo.Manifest SET Status = Approved WHERE Status = Proposed
API --> Admin: 200 (nothing filed or enqueued)

== Declarations (per vehicle) ==

Dispatcher -> API: POST .../declarations/{kind}/ready
API -> DB: store the load snapshot

Dispatcher -> API: GET .../declarations/ens/filing-sheet
API --> Dispatcher: sheet without the consignee address
Dispatcher -> EU: file the ENS
GO -> EU: enter the consignee address
EU --> Dispatcher: MRN
Dispatcher -> API: POST .../declarations/ens/record (MRN)
API -> Blob: declarations/{id}.json (IfNoneMatch: write-once)

alt GMR and ELO in manual mode (default)
  Dispatcher -> API: POST .../declarations/{gmr|elo}/record (reference)
  API -> DB: declaration Filed
else automatic mode
  Dispatcher -> API: POST .../declarations/elo/file
  API -> DB: refuse unless ENS Accepted
  API -> EloQueue: envelope request
  API -> DB: ELO Filed
  EloQueue -> Worker: dequeue
  Worker -> Elo: create envelope (crossing profile + MRN)
  Elo --> Worker: numeroDossier + barcode
  Worker -> Blob: elo/...
  Dispatcher -> API: POST .../declarations/gmr/file
  API -> GmrQueue: GMR submission
  GmrQueue -> Worker: dequeue
  Worker -> HMRC: create GMR
  Worker -> Blob: gmr/...
end

== The load changes after filing ==

Dispatcher -> API: move or replace a box
API -> DB: affected manifests back to Proposed
API --> Dispatcher: declarations now read Stale; re-declare tasks raised

@enduml
